<!DOCTYPE HTML>
<html lang=en>

<head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8"/>
    <title><%= @config[:title] %> :: WTF?!</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/vqvz.css" type="text/css" media="screen" title="default style sheet" charset="utf-8" />
</head>

<body>
<%= erubis(:_gallery_banner, :layout => false) %>
<div id="content">
    <div id="header">
        <h2>WTF</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="photo hentry" id="about">
        <p><a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/funkaoshi/4191380555/" title="Shima by funkaoshi, on Flickr"><img src="http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2597/4191380555_16e8c1dce3.jpg" width="500" height="320" alt="Shima" /></a></p>
        <p>Something has gone horribly wrong. The page you are looking for isn't here. Maybe you typed in the URL wrong? It's also quite possible this is all my fault. Let's not play the blame game.</p>
        <% unless request.env['sinatra.error'].nil? %><p>Does this mean anything to you? — <%= request.env['sinatra.error'].name %><% end %>
    </div>
</div>
<%= erubis(:_google_analytics, :layout => false) %>
</body>

</html>
